<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss share index hits 5,000 points.</title>
<headline>Swiss share index hits 5,000 points.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss blue-chip SMI share index hit a new all-time high in Monday morning trading, breaking the 5,000 point level for the first time ever.</p>
<p>The index was 49.7 points higher at 5,003.02 at 0815 GMT.</p>
<p>Swiss shares finished at their third consecutive record close on Friday, gaining 55.9 points to end at 4,953.5.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
